---
const repo = "https://github.com/Jawuilp/Limitcode";
const issues = repo + "/issues";
const email = "hola@jawuil.dev";
---

<section id="feedback" class="container">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="section-num reveal">11 — Feedback and issues</span>
    <h2 class="reveal d1">Found a bug, or have a suggestion?</h2>
    <p class="reveal d2">
      Have a comment, question, suggestion or bug report? Open an issue in
      <a href={repo} target="_blank" rel="noopener">this repository</a> — it is the
      preferred place for anything reproducible and public. You can also reach out
      by email if you prefer.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="feedback-grid">
    <article class="feedback-card reveal">
      <span class="feedback-kicker">Limitcode Pro reports</span>
      <h3>Tag it so it is easy to sort.</h3>
      <p>
        If your report is about Limitcode Pro, add the <code>[Pro]</code> tag to the
        end of the title — for example <code>Too many logs in console! [Pro]</code> —
        so Pro and open-source issues are easy to tell apart.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="feedback-card reveal d1">
      <span class="feedback-kicker">By email</span>
      <h3>Prefer not to post in public?</h3>
      <p>
        Write to <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>. Best for anything private
        or account-related.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="note feedback-warn reveal">
    <span class="kicker">Before you post</span>
    Do not paste provider API keys or tokens, personal data, or logs and screenshots
    that contain your own code, prompts or file paths. For anything sensitive, use
    <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>email</a> instead.
  </div>

  <a class="docs-link feedback-cta reveal" href={issues} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
    Open an issue on GitHub <span>→</span>
  </a>
</section>

<style>
  .feedback-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 780px) {
    .feedback-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .feedback-card {
    padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px);
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    background: var(--paper-deep);
  }

  .feedback-kicker {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-prose);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .feedback-card h3 {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    max-width: 22ch;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .feedback-card p {
    max-width: 48ch;
  }

  .feedback-card code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.84em;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  #feedback a {
    color: var(--sublime);
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
    padding-bottom: 1px;
    transition: color 140ms ease;
  }

  #feedback a:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .feedback-warn {
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .feedback-cta {
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
</style>
